<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Mediolanum.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Mediolanum.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mediolanum SpA, an Italian insurance and financial services group, was rated &quot;trading buy&quot; as Goldman Sachs began coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Futher detail was not immediataly available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
